ounty"],["ARC or PLC in Rock County","/arc-plc/nebraska/rock-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of the 11 Rock County grids has 75 years on record, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle ran 153% of normal for July to August and 40% for November to December. So far in 2026 the middle sat at 26% for February to March and 125% for June to July. Grid 27122 had its driest year in 1989 at 52% of normal.</p>"}
